# Assignment email. The defaults ARE the existing mailbox — leave these blank
# unless you are deliberately sending as someone else.
#
#   From:    WEEHS <info@weehs.org>
#   SMTP:    mail.privateemail.com:465
#   User:    info@weehs.org
#   Links:   https://suite.weehs.org
#
# The password is not a default and must not be written here. It is the
# password for info@weehs.org, stored as a secret:
#
#   firebase functions:secrets:set SMTP_PASS
#
# The emulator reads it from functions/.secret.local:
#
#   SMTP_PASS=the-mailbox-password
#
# Until that secret is the real password, the triggers log an error and do
# not send. The assignment write itself still succeeds. See DEPLOYMENT.md §6.

# Uncomment only to override the mailbox above.
# SMTP_HOST=mail.privateemail.com
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_USER=info@weehs.org
# MAIL_FROM=WEEHS <info@weehs.org>
# APP_ORIGIN=https://suite.weehs.org
